{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：21:21 2026-09-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：21:21 2026-09-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：21:21 2026-09-25 HKT</p><p>今日是中秋佳節，不少人都到維園參觀國際中秋綵燈匯應節，感受中秋氣氛。不過因應「世界綵燈大街」現時參觀人流眾多，旅發局指出，考慮到公眾安全及秩序，將會停止排隊進入展區。</p><p>旅發局又重申，「國際中秋綵燈匯」所有綵燈展出日期將延長至 10 月 4 日，歡迎市民及旅客於其他時段到場欣賞。旅發局衷心感謝市民及旅客的支持及配合，並呼籲參觀人士遵從現場工作人員指示。旅發局會因應現場實際情況，適時於官方網站公布最新安排。</p><img alt=\"維園中秋彩燈會。吳艷玲攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/42d63cf1abeab359f35e0825da7845fb/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_192902903_01_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/6104ed03786a38b8da59a0f9c4634ffa/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_192902903_02_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/81e76c77e4fe2b9668ee9379d8a5e0dd/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_01_1_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/88509b8d25bb82299b7bfd22feca4e85/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_02_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/d1e2a1e654954d8da21e80104b120a1a/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_03_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/52a146adca86da64c40151311693c387/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_04_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/28daee9cb12843d9888b642e4c5d6e34/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_05_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/1350b1124a0f9cbfc48cf0482dcccec4/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_06_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/2e6491bbcafc9d7a8f6a3e3056c4c051/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_07_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/3b8092f7cdbc27d3b8d71c1cdfc3e2eb/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_08_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/2b4c25e8200d0be7803aa027ef78c639/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_09_-_.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl/40844e98313019a3b618766c87b0483c/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260925_194452207_10_-_.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T13:39:09.443935+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":286,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}